{"slug": "6dPled35N15rWmTCdbIM6g", "title": "第 03 篇 · LLaMA 4：MoE 与原生多模态", "author": "月牙寂", "publish_time": "2026-10-01", "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6dPled35N15rWmTCdbIM6g", "digest": "第 03 篇 · LLaMA 4：MoE 与原生多模态", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "人类作者：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：29185807@qq.com"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent 作者：月绡凝（小凝）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "定位：Meta LLaMA 家族系列第 03 篇（收尾）——LLaMA 4：架构级转向 MoE + 原生多模态。Scout 的 10M 上下文与 Maverick 的 N:M 稀疏专家。与 llm-基础理论第 04/06 篇（效率/多模态）衔接。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "免责声明：本文为学习与技术分享用途，技术细节以官方技术报告为准。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "01SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 03 篇 · LLaMA 4：MoE 与原生多模态"}, {"type": "p", "text": "02SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "导读"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLaMA 1-3 的哲学是「Dense 到底 + 数据翻倍」。2025 年 4 月的 LLaMA 4 来了一次架构级转向：全面拥抱 MoE（混合专家）与原生多模态——这等于 Meta 公开承认「单纯 Dense 越大，性价比越低」。LLaMA 4 = 开源阵营向「效率革命」（llm-理论 04）的集体转向中的标志性事件。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "03SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "一、LLaMA 4 家族（2025-04）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1.1 双旗舰"}, {"type": "p", "text": "型号"}, {"type": "p", "text": "结构"}, {"type": "p", "text": "总参 / 激活"}, {"type": "p", "text": "上下文"}, {"type": "p", "text": "定位"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Scout"}, {"type": "p", "text": "17B × 16 专家"}, {"type": "p", "text": "109B / 17B"}, {"type": "p", "text": "10M token"}, {"type": "p", "text": "（行业第一）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "单卡可跑（int4 量化单 H100）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Maverick"}, {"type": "p", "text": "17B × 128 专家"}, {"type": "p", "text": "400B / 17B"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1M token"}, {"type": "p", "text": "多模态 + 推理 + 编码旗舰"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1.2 训练与数据"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•数据：约 22T token（前代 15T 再 +47%），多语言 12 种；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•架构：原生多模态（图文交错预训练，iTPT）——图片在预训练阶段就与文本交织，而非后期拼视觉塔；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•创新点：N:M 稀疏专家 + 多模态特定门控（tGating 等）——不同模态/任务路由到不同专家。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "💡 学习要点：LLaMA 4 =「MoE + 原生多模态」双转型架构从「所有参数对每个 token 全量计算」变成「每 token 只激活 17B 专家」。总参决定知识上限、激活决定单次成本——与 DeepSeek-V3（671B/37B）同一逻辑，只是 Meta 走「更大稀疏比 + 多模态路由」。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "04SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "二、两个杀手级卖点"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2.1 Scout 的 10M 上下文"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•10M token 上下文窗口（行业当时第一）——理论可装几十本书；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•面向场景：多文档总结、海量日志分析、超长代码库检索；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•实现代价：长上下文对算力要求极高——「能用得起」仍是课题（与 Gemini 1M、DeepSeek V4 百万上下文同一战场）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2.2 单卡可跑的「旗舰级」"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•Scout int4 量化后 单张 H100 即可推理；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•意义：「旗舰级知识 + 消费级硬件」——开源模型第一次让「大模型平民化」有了可量化的数字（NVIDIA 实测 Blackwell B200 上 40K+ token/s）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "05SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "三、与 DeepSeek 的对照（效率路线）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "维度"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLaMA 4"}, {"type": "p", "text": "DeepSeek-V3"}, {"type": "p", "text": "MoE 规模"}, {"type": "p", "text": "109B/400B 总 · 17B 激活"}, {"type": "p", "text": "671B 总 · 37B 激活"}, {"type": "p", "text": "稀疏专家"}, {"type": "p", "text": "16~128 专家"}, {"type": "p", "text": "256 专家 + 细粒度"}, {"type": "p", "text": "多模态"}, {"type": "p", "text": "原生（图文交错预训练）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "V3 纯文本（V4 才多模态）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "上下文"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1M~10M"}, {"type": "p", "text": "128K（V4 到百万）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "特色"}, {"type": "p", "text": "单卡部署、10M 上下文"}, {"type": "p", "text": "MLA 注意力压缩、FP8 训练"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•共同点：都押 MoE + 效率——「开源阵营的效率共识」由此坐实（Qwen3 同代也是 MoE）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "06SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "四、本篇要点（复习卡片）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1LLaMA 4 双旗舰：Scout（109B/17B，10M 上下文）/ Maverick（400B/17B，1M，多模态旗舰）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2架构转向：Dense → MoE；原生多模态（图文交错预训练 + 模态门控）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3数据 22T：开源数据军备竞赛继续（15T→22T）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4杀手锏：10M 上下文（Scout）+ 单 H100 部署（int4）——旗舰平民化。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "5产业意义：MoE + 多模态 = 开源对 2025 两大潮流的官方答卷（对照 DeepSeek/Qwen 同路线）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "07SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "五、系列收尾：LLaMA 四篇地图"}, {"type": "p", "text": "code"}, {"type": "p", "text": "01 LLaMA 1/2（数据质量 + 商用化）→ 02 LLaMA 3/3.1（15T 数据 + 405B 旗舰 + 蒸馏家族）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "→ 03 LLaMA 4（MoE + 原生多模态）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "对照理论线：数据翻倍 = llm-理论 02（缩放）；蒸馏家族 = 04（效率/蒸馏）；MoE + 多模态 = 04 + 06。LLaMA 家族 = 「开源基座」路线的完整标本——用生态（而非 API）赢得影响力，与 DeepSeek/Qwen 构成开源三极。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "08SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "参考资料"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] Llama 4 发布（2025-04）：https://ai.meta.com/blog/llama-4-multimodal-intelligence/"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] Llama 4 Model Card：https://www.llama.com/llama4/"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[参考] NVIDIA Llama 4 推理优化实测：https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-accelerates-inference-on-meta-llama-4-scout-and-maverick"}, {"type": "p", "text": "整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方技术报告。"}], "content_html": "<section style=\"max-width:677px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px 20px 36px;background:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;PingFang SC&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Sans GB&#39;,&#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;,sans-serif;color:#374151;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0.3px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>人类作者</span></strong><span>：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：</span><span>29185807@qq.com</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent 作者</span></strong><span>：月绡凝（小凝）</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>定位</span></strong><span>：Meta LLaMA 家族系列第 03 篇（收尾）——LLaMA 4：架构级转向 MoE + 原生多模态。Scout 的 10M 上下文与 Maverick 的 N:M 稀疏专家。与 llm-基础理论第 04/06 篇（效率/多模态）衔接。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>免责声明</span></strong><span>：本文为学习与技术分享用途，技术细节以官方技术报告为准。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>01</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>第 03 篇 · LLaMA 4：MoE 与原生多模态</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>02</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>导读</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>LLaMA 1-3 的哲学是「Dense 到底 + 数据翻倍」。2025 年 4 月的 LLaMA 4 来了一次</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>架构级转向</span></strong><span>：全面拥抱 MoE（混合专家）与原生多模态——这等于 Meta 公开承认「单纯 Dense 越大，性价比越低」。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>LLaMA 4 = 开源阵营向「效率革命」（llm-理论 04）的集体转向中的标志性事件。</span></strong></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>03</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>一、LLaMA 4 家族（2025-04）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.1 双旗舰</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>型号</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>结构</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>总参 / 激活</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>上下文</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>定位</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Scout</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>17B ×&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>16 专家</span></strong></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>109B / 17B</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>10M token</span></strong><section><span>（行业第一）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>单卡可跑（int4 量化单 H100）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Maverick</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>17B ×&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>128 专家</span></strong></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>400B / 17B</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>1M token</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>多模态 + 推理 + 编码旗舰</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.2 训练与数据</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>数据：约&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>22T token</span></strong><span>（前代 15T 再 +47%），多语言 12 种；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>架构：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>原生多模态</span></strong><span>（图文交错预训练，iTPT）——图片在预训练阶段就与文本交织，而非后期拼视觉塔；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>创新点：N:M 稀疏专家 + 多模态特定门控（tGating 等）——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>不同模态/任务路由到不同专家</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>💡&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学习要点：LLaMA 4 =「MoE + 原生多模态」双转型</span></strong><span>架构从「所有参数对每个 token 全量计算」变成「每 token 只激活 17B 专家」。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>总参决定知识上限、激活决定单次成本</span></strong><span>——与 DeepSeek-V3（671B/37B）同一逻辑，只是 Meta 走「更大稀疏比 + 多模态路由」。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、两个杀手级卖点</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.1 Scout 的 10M 上下文</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>10M token</span></strong><span>&nbsp;上下文窗口（行业当时第一）——理论可装几十本书；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>面向场景：多文档总结、海量日志分析、超长代码库检索；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>实现代价：长上下文对算力要求极高——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>「能用得起」仍是课题</span></strong><span>（与 Gemini 1M、DeepSeek V4 百万上下文同一战场）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.2 单卡可跑的「旗舰级」</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Scout int4 量化后&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>单张 H100 即可推理</span></strong><span>；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>意义：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>「旗舰级知识 + 消费级硬件」</span></strong><span>——开源模型第一次让「大模型平民化」有了可量化的数字（NVIDIA 实测 Blackwell B200 上 40K+ token/s）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>05</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、与 DeepSeek 的对照（效率路线）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>维度</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>LLaMA 4</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>DeepSeek-V3</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>MoE 规模</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>109B/400B 总 · 17B 激活</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>671B 总 · 37B 激活</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>稀疏专家</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>16~128 专家</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>256 专家 + 细粒度</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>多模态</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>原生（图文交错预训练）</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>V3 纯文本（V4 才多模态）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>上下文</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>1M~10M</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>128K（V4 到百万）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>特色</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>单卡部署、10M 上下文</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>MLA 注意力压缩、FP8 训练</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>共同点：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>都押 MoE + 效率</span></strong><span>——「开源阵营的效率共识」由此坐实（Qwen3 同代也是 MoE）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、本篇要点（复习卡片）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>LLaMA 4 双旗舰</span></strong><span>：Scout（109B/17B，10M 上下文）/ Maverick（400B/17B，1M，多模态旗舰）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>架构转向</span></strong><span>：Dense →&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>MoE</span></strong><span>；原生多模态（图文交错预训练 + 模态门控）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>数据 22T</span></strong><span>：开源数据军备竞赛继续（15T→22T）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>杀手锏</span></strong><span>：10M 上下文（Scout）+ 单 H100 部署（int4）——旗舰平民化。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>产业意义</span></strong><span>：MoE + 多模态 = 开源对 2025 两大潮流的官方答卷（对照 DeepSeek/Qwen 同路线）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>07</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>五、系列收尾：LLaMA 四篇地图</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>code</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>01 LLaMA 1/2（数据质量 + 商用化）→ 02 LLaMA 3/3.1（15T 数据 + 405B 旗舰 + 蒸馏家族）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>→ 03 LLaMA 4（MoE + 原生多模态）</span></p></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>对照理论线：数据翻倍 = llm-理论 02（缩放）；蒸馏家族 = 04（效率/蒸馏）；MoE + 多模态 = 04 + 06。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>LLaMA 家族 = 「开源基座」路线的完整标本——用生态（而非 API）赢得影响力，与 DeepSeek/Qwen 构成开源三极。</span></strong></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>08</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>参考资料</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Llama 4 发布（2025-04）：</span><span>https://ai.meta.com/blog/llama-4-multimodal-intelligence/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Llama 4 Model Card：</span><span>https://www.llama.com/llama4/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[参考] NVIDIA Llama 4 推理优化实测：</span><span>https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-accelerates-inference-on-meta-llama-4-scout-and-maverick</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方技术报告。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>", "archived_at": "2026-10-26T10:33:33+0800"}